## E7 — Cognition and Intelligence

### E7.1 Cognitive Organization

Ontology defines a Cognitive System as a System realizing a Cognitive Architecture and one or more Cognitive Processes under a declared cognition criterion. Emergence evaluates the actual organization and capacity; it does not infer cognition from a label or isolated output.

    CognitionCriterion {
      candidate_system
      distinctions acquired_or_formed
      retention relations
      integration relations
      transformation and evaluation relations
      use across more_than_one immediate coupling
      model_use_or_internal organization: [Criterion] | NONE | OPEN
